    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Mercy Mukubwa, MSc Advanced Practice Midwifery student at the Aga Khan University's School of Nursing and Midwifery, East Africa, recently presented her research at the  International Council of Nurses (ICN) Congress 2025  in Helsinki, Finland. Her research study, titled \"Exploring Factors Informing the Choice of Caesarean Section Among Couples and Healthcare Workers: A Case of The Nairobi Hospital, Kenya,\" was selected from a competitive global pool, marking a significant achievement in her academic career.",
